{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131690/extras/BUILD_YOUR_CAREER.png?t=1741637577\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start as an ordinary cargo worker and gradually grow your cargo company by hiring new employees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131690/extras/BUILD_YOUR_CAREER.gif?t=1741637577\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131690/extras/OFFICE_MANAGEMENT.png?t=1741637577\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your office to be organized and efficient. Manage your cargo shelves and ensure a seamless experience for your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131690/extras/OFFICE_MANAGEMENT.gif?t=1741637577\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131690/extras/PROGRESS.png?t=1741637577\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invest your earnings into your company to grow. Expand your office, unlock new features to diversify your revenue streams, and automate processes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131690/extras/GROW.gif?t=1741637577\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131690/extras/DELIVERY.png?t=1741637577\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set out for cargo delivery with your vehicle. Deliver to neighborhoods, the city, and drop-off points. If you prefer, you can also hire a courier.</p><p